00:00:19.014 --> 00:00:20.132
- [Voiceover] Are you guys ready to play?

00:00:20.132 --> 00:00:20.800
- Yeah.
- Yeah.

00:00:20.800 --> 00:00:21.164
- Yeah.

00:00:21.164 --> 00:00:24.191
